{"id":640,"date":"2026-08-15T22:35:57","date_gmt":"2026-08-15T22:35:57","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=640"},"modified":"2026-08-16T06:58:05","modified_gmt":"2026-08-16T06:58:05","slug":"page-views-notes-numbering","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/page-management\/page-views-notes-numbering\/","title":{"rendered":"Page Views, Notes &#038; Numbering"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Views, Notes &amp; Numbering<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-646 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageViewsNotesAndNumbering-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"130\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageViewsNotesAndNumbering-1.webp 423w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageViewsNotesAndNumbering-1-286x300.webp 286w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 124px) 100vw, 124px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">This guide covers essential document management tools that help you navigate, organise, and format multi-page publications efficiently.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Creating a New Document<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-649 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-055436.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"178\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-055436.png 557w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-055436-300x273.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 178px) 100vw, 178px\" \/>To start a fresh publication, go to <strong>File &gt; New<\/strong>. This opens the template browser, where you can select from a range of professionally designed publication templates (newsletters, flyers, posters, business cards, etc.) or choose a blank canvas at a standard size. Once selected, a new, untitled document opens at the specified dimensions.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Two-Page Spread Mode<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-651 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/two-pageSpreadModes.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"99\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/two-pageSpreadModes.webp 537w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/two-pageSpreadModes-300x249.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 120px) 100vw, 120px\" \/>For publications designed as booklets or magazines, enable Two-Page Spread Mode from the Navigation Pane context menu. In this view, facing pages are displayed side by side in the sidebar thumbnails, allowing you to visualise the relationship between a left-hand and a right-hand page as readers will see them.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Notes<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-653 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Page-Notes.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Page-Notes.webp 422w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Page-Notes-290x300.webp 290w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">For larger, multi-page documents, it can be helpful to label individual pages so they are easy to identify at a glance without clicking into them. Open Publisher&#8217;s Page Notes feature lets you attach a short custom identifier to any page.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>How to add a Page Note:\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click a page thumbnail in the left-hand Navigation Pane.<strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-656 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061132.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"444\" height=\"217\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061132.png 1186w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061132-300x147.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061132-1024x501.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061132-768x376.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 444px) 100vw, 444px\" \/><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select <strong>Add Note<\/strong> from the context menu.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Type a short label &#8211; for example: Front Cover, TOC, Back Cover, Chapter 3.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The note appears directly beneath the page thumbnail in a bold, teal-coloured font.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">To remove a note, right-click the page, select Add Note, and leave the input field blank before confirming. The note will be cleared automatically.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><em>Note: Page Notes are purely for your own organisational use within the editor. They do not affect page numbering, printed output, or exported files.<\/em><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Multi-Page View<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-659 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061449.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"243\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061449.png 1229w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061449-300x189.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061449-1024x645.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-061449-768x484.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 386px) 100vw, 386px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">When you zoom out to 45% or below on a document that contains more than one page, Open Publisher automatically activates Multi-Page View. In this mode, all pages are rendered side-by-side in the workspace, giving you a bird&#8217;s-eye overview of your entire publication at once.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>Key behaviours of Multi-Page View:\u00a0<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-666 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Multi-PageView-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"165\" height=\"224\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Multi-PageView-1.webp 521w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Multi-PageView-1-220x300.webp 220w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 165px) 100vw, 165px\" \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">All non-active pages are shown as read-only preview clones, rendered at full 1:1 quality.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The active (editable) page is clearly labelled with an &#8220;(Editing)&#8221; badge and retains full interactivity &#8211; you can type, drag, and select elements normally.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Clicking any preview page instantly swaps it to become the active editable page, while the previously active page converts to a read-only preview in its place &#8211; all without changing your zoom level.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Pages are always arranged horizontally in a single row, calculated to fit your display width.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">To exit Multi-Page View, simply zoom back in above 45%.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Auto Page Numbering<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-669 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-064243.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"221\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-064243.png 327w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-16-064243-242x300.png 242w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 179px) 100vw, 179px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">For longer documents, manually updating page numbers is tedious. Open Publisher provides an Auto Page Numbers feature that inserts dynamic, self-updating number tags.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>How to insert auto page numbers:<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-674 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoPageNumbering-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"158\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoPageNumbering-1.webp 411w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AutoPageNumbering-1-268x300.webp 268w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 141px) 100vw, 141px\" \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Navigate to the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon tab.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click <strong>Page Number<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A page number element is inserted at your cursor position. It automatically displays the correct number for each page and updates itself as you add, remove, or reorder pages in your document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Page Views, Notes &amp; Numbering This guide covers essential document management tools that help you navigate, organise, and format multi-page publications efficiently. Creating a New Document To start a fresh publication, go to File &gt; New. This opens the template browser, where you can select from a range of professionally designed publication templates (newsletters, flyers, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":677,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[9],"class_list":["post-640","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-page-management"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/640","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=640"}],"version-history":[{"count":19,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/640\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":676,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/640\/revisions\/676"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/677"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=640"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=640"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}